00:09.308 --> 00:12.895
Izu Spring Festival! Yay!

00:13.979 --> 00:17.816
Be passionate, my friends

00:17.983 --> 00:20.986
Shine bright with the sun

00:21.153 --> 00:24.531
Dive into the blue sky

00:24.740 --> 00:28.452
And let summer take it all

00:31.830 --> 00:35.417
GRAND BLUE DREAMING

00:42.716 --> 00:46.553
Be passionate, my friends

00:46.720 --> 00:49.807
Shine bright with the sun

00:49.974 --> 00:53.143
Dive into the blue sky

00:53.310 --> 00:57.356
And let summer take it all

00:57.523 --> 01:00.359
An expanding ocean of possibilities

01:00.526 --> 01:04.405
Summer is our amore

01:04.571 --> 01:08.075
We'll swear to the crystal clear sky

01:08.242 --> 01:11.203
Summer is in our hands

01:11.370 --> 01:15.291
Be passionate, my friends

01:15.457 --> 01:18.460
Shine bright with the sun

01:18.627 --> 01:21.964
Dive into the blue sky

01:22.131 --> 01:25.551
And let summer take it all

01:25.718 --> 01:29.722
With a cheerful heart

01:29.888 --> 01:32.725
Don't mess with me

01:32.891 --> 01:36.228
Keep going even if you fall

01:36.395 --> 01:40.024
And let summer take it all

01:45.029 --> 01:46.113
OKONOMIYAKI

01:46.280 --> 01:48.073
I was happy...

01:48.240 --> 01:50.784
But it looks like we have to man the stall.

01:50.951 --> 01:52.328
Thanks for waiting.

01:52.494 --> 01:53.787
Thanks for your hard work!

01:54.288 --> 01:56.081
How's everything going?

01:56.248 --> 01:58.584
All right.

01:58.751 --> 02:01.045
It looks like we have a competitor.

02:05.090 --> 02:07.134
Oh, it's Tinkerbell.

02:07.301 --> 02:08.469
Tinkerbell?

02:08.635 --> 02:12.431
It's a tennis club with lots of cute guys
and the highest ratio of girls.

02:14.641 --> 02:16.852
- How about trash?
- Pig's blood would be better.

02:17.019 --> 02:19.855
Stop talking about
what you want to throw at them.

02:20.022 --> 02:21.482
Hey!

02:21.648 --> 02:24.443
It's so hot!

02:25.069 --> 02:26.195
You walked here?

02:26.362 --> 02:28.197
I rode the bus part way.

02:28.364 --> 02:30.741
How can you talk
like everything's normal?

02:30.908 --> 02:32.409
Please put this on.

02:32.576 --> 02:33.702
I'm okay.

02:33.869 --> 02:34.870
No!

02:35.037 --> 02:36.789
Why are you dressed like that?

02:36.955 --> 02:39.375
My shirt just got drenched.

02:39.541 --> 02:41.752
Shouldn't you wash that?

02:41.919 --> 02:44.671
It's going to get dirty again tonight
when you guys puke.

02:44.838 --> 02:46.673
What's going to happen tonight?

02:46.840 --> 02:49.218
This is the devil's festival.

02:51.470 --> 02:53.639
Why don't you go look for a T-shirt?

02:53.806 --> 02:56.100
I'm fine with this.

02:56.266 --> 02:58.102
That's a little too...

02:58.268 --> 03:02.064
I guess you're right.
Come with me, Iori.

03:02.231 --> 03:04.024
Wait, why do I have to go?

03:04.191 --> 03:06.485
Welcome! Please have a look!

03:08.529 --> 03:11.365
School festivals are so lively. I love them!

03:11.532 --> 03:14.118
You seem like the type who likes festivals.

03:14.284 --> 03:16.120
Well, yeah.

03:16.286 --> 03:18.580
- Since we're talking about our interests...
- Yes?

03:18.747 --> 03:22.000
What type of guys do you like?

03:22.709 --> 03:25.295
- What do you mean? That's random!
- Well...

03:25.462 --> 03:28.340
You know, we're both into the same stuff...

03:28.507 --> 03:29.758
Now that you mention it...

03:29.925 --> 03:33.178
Actually, I'm okay with both too.

03:33.345 --> 03:35.681
Anyway, as for guys, I like Tokki.

03:35.848 --> 03:37.808
For girls, I like Nanaka.

03:37.975 --> 03:39.184
Nanaka?

03:39.393 --> 03:40.686
So how about you?

03:41.353 --> 03:42.354
What do you mean?

03:42.521 --> 03:44.189
What type do you like?

03:44.356 --> 03:48.902
Clear up the misunderstanding!
This is my only chance to tell her I'm not bi!

03:49.069 --> 03:50.612
Actually...

03:50.779 --> 03:53.198
I'm so glad I met someone like me.

03:53.365 --> 03:57.578
Even I can't talk about this stuff
with other people.

03:57.744 --> 04:00.664
Help me, God!

04:00.831 --> 04:03.041
So, what's your type, Iori?

04:03.876 --> 04:05.419
Hey, Kitahara.

04:05.586 --> 04:06.587
What?

04:06.753 --> 04:11.341
Why did Azusa say she wants to switch shifts
with me all of a sudden?

04:11.508 --> 04:13.343
I wonder...

04:13.510 --> 04:17.222
- Just go off and have fun alone with Iori!
- Okay...

04:18.515 --> 04:20.767
It's just that...

04:20.934 --> 04:22.895
I feel bad for doing this to you.

04:23.061 --> 04:25.814
You bastard. What did you get me into?

04:28.025 --> 04:29.735
It's so peaceful.

04:29.902 --> 04:32.029
It's because the others aren't here.

04:32.196 --> 04:34.448
It's nice to spend time like this sometimes.

04:35.073 --> 04:37.075
It's Iori and Kohei!

04:37.242 --> 04:38.994
You came at a good time.

04:39.161 --> 04:40.204
What?

04:40.370 --> 04:45.334
We were talking about going out drinking
with some other clubs we interact with.

04:45.501 --> 04:47.085
So it's a mixer.

04:47.252 --> 04:48.712
So cute girls will be there?

04:49.755 --> 04:52.216
Check with them.

04:55.135 --> 04:56.637
RUGBY CLUB

04:56.803 --> 05:00.224
- Yeah!
- There definitely won't be any girls.

05:00.766 --> 05:01.934
So how about it?

05:02.100 --> 05:03.769
Want to come over to our tent?

05:03.936 --> 05:05.854
It's going to be fun.

05:06.021 --> 05:08.190
I'm not really interested...

05:08.357 --> 05:10.192
How many do you want to order?

05:10.359 --> 05:12.736
I'll buy five, tell me your Line ID.

05:13.695 --> 05:14.780
Hey.

05:14.947 --> 05:16.740
You look like you're having fun.

05:16.907 --> 05:19.743
Do you want to die?

05:20.827 --> 05:22.663
- Friends of yours?
- Yeah.

05:22.829 --> 05:24.790
We'll come invite you again.

05:24.957 --> 05:25.958
Throw the salt!

05:26.124 --> 05:27.793
Be gone, demons!

05:27.960 --> 05:31.046
- Thanks for helping us out.
- Great.

05:31.213 --> 05:33.215
Do you want to switch shifts?

05:33.382 --> 05:34.383
Okay.

05:34.550 --> 05:37.469
Then let's have Chii-chan switch with Iori.

05:37.636 --> 05:39.429
Okay.

05:39.596 --> 05:42.391
Tell me how things went with Kohei.

05:43.183 --> 05:45.394
- What's wrong?
- Nothing.

05:45.561 --> 05:48.355
I'll work the stall with Chisa.
You can take a break.

05:48.522 --> 05:51.441
I've been working the whole time.

05:51.608 --> 05:52.901
Please!

05:54.611 --> 05:55.862
Sorry, Chisa.

05:56.029 --> 05:58.156
Come on. Tell me why.

05:58.323 --> 06:00.450
Well, how should I put it...

06:00.617 --> 06:03.370
I want to avoid being left alone with Azusa.

06:03.537 --> 06:07.124
Well, Azusa is pretty, after all.

06:07.291 --> 06:09.459
You get nervous when you're with her, right?

06:09.626 --> 06:12.296
Well, I guess I do get nervous...

06:12.462 --> 06:14.881
What's with that answer?

06:15.048 --> 06:16.216
Welcome!

06:16.383 --> 06:19.428
- Thanks.
- One moment please.

06:24.433 --> 06:26.602
What time is the women's beauty pageant?

06:26.768 --> 06:29.354
It's at 4. The award ceremony is tomorrow.

06:29.521 --> 06:31.231
Ours is tonight.

06:31.398 --> 06:34.735
- Thanks for waiting. 600 yen, please.
- Okay.

06:34.901 --> 06:37.112
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

06:37.279 --> 06:38.614
PEEK-A-BOO

06:39.573 --> 06:41.575
Shouldn't you start getting ready?

06:41.742 --> 06:44.202
I was just going to go like this.

06:45.078 --> 06:47.039
You can't do that, Chii-chan.

06:47.205 --> 06:51.627
You're cute, so we have to get
lots of people to notice you.

06:51.793 --> 06:53.629
This is our chance.

06:53.795 --> 06:55.130
Good luck.

06:55.297 --> 06:56.840
Where did Kotegawa go?

06:57.007 --> 06:59.134
To do her makeup
for the beauty pageant.

06:59.301 --> 07:01.511
Are you having them do yours next?

07:01.678 --> 07:04.139
Are you trying to embarrass me?

07:04.306 --> 07:06.642
You have long hair.
You should dress up as a girl!

07:06.808 --> 07:10.896
No! You're the one entering the joke category!

07:11.313 --> 07:14.900
Hey! We're going to close the stall
and go watch!

07:15.067 --> 07:17.778
IZU UNIVERSITY SPRING FESTIVAL
WOMEN'S BEAUTY PAGEANT

07:21.365 --> 07:23.325
There's a lot of people here.

07:23.492 --> 07:26.620
This is the main event, along with the male pageant.

07:26.787 --> 07:29.164
We're going on stage in front of
such a huge crowd?

07:29.331 --> 07:32.250
You'll be fine.
You'll be dressed as a guy.

07:32.417 --> 07:34.252
You're not happy in the joke category?

07:34.419 --> 07:36.755
I don't understand why I have to enter.

07:36.922 --> 07:39.549
What are you talking about?
Look, Iori.

07:43.428 --> 07:45.597
AINA YOSHIWARA
(20 YEARS OLD)

07:45.764 --> 07:47.349
That's a lot of makeup.

07:47.516 --> 07:51.103
The other clubs are also entering the joke category.

07:51.269 --> 07:54.106
Aina-chan, you're so cute!

07:54.272 --> 07:56.566
Hi!

08:10.664 --> 08:13.500
She looks harsh.

08:13.667 --> 08:15.460
Is she mad?

08:15.627 --> 08:18.004
Please say your name and your club.

08:18.171 --> 08:20.257
I'm Chisa Kotegawa from Peek-a-Boo.

08:20.424 --> 08:21.967
I think she's nervous.

08:22.134 --> 08:24.010
Kotegawa's so awkward.

08:24.177 --> 08:25.220
This is bad.

08:25.387 --> 08:28.014
At this rate, she might lose.

08:28.181 --> 08:30.225
- What's your hobby?
- Diving.

08:30.392 --> 08:32.561
Kohei, do you have any ideas?

08:32.728 --> 08:34.771
You know lots about these games, right?

08:34.938 --> 08:38.525
Well, you're right. I do know a lot...

08:38.692 --> 08:43.321
If you want to make a quiet girl shine,
you make her smile.

08:43.488 --> 08:46.033
Brother Kohei...

08:46.199 --> 08:47.242
Smile?

08:47.409 --> 08:49.619
It's hard to make Chisa smile.

08:49.786 --> 08:52.456
If we smile, maybe she'll smile too.

08:52.622 --> 08:54.040
Let's try that!

08:54.207 --> 08:56.001
Chisa!

09:00.088 --> 09:01.423
No! We made it worse!

09:01.590 --> 09:03.925
She shouldn't make that face
in front of the crowd.

09:04.092 --> 09:05.510
Do you have any other ideas?

09:05.677 --> 09:08.555
How about showing them her bashful side?

09:08.722 --> 09:09.848
Bashful?

09:10.015 --> 09:11.600
How can we do that?

09:11.767 --> 09:13.810
Based on what I know...

09:13.977 --> 09:15.937
Can you introduce your club?

09:16.104 --> 09:17.397
Chisa!

09:18.607 --> 09:20.567
WE LOVE CHISA

09:24.237 --> 09:25.489
She's not being bashful.

09:25.655 --> 09:27.783
That's weird. Normally...

09:27.949 --> 09:29.701
Why are you doing this?

09:29.868 --> 09:31.328
She would say that.

09:31.495 --> 09:34.331
She looks like she's looking at trash.
Our plan failed.

09:34.498 --> 09:36.708
- There's only one thing left.
- What is it?

09:36.875 --> 09:39.961
- Today's outfit.
- Okay. We're lifting up her skirt.

09:40.128 --> 09:41.838
I didn't even have to say it.

09:42.005 --> 09:43.006
How come he knew?

09:43.173 --> 09:44.841
You have weird ideas.

09:45.008 --> 09:47.093
How are we going to lift up her skirt?

09:47.260 --> 09:49.971
- Look at these!
- Bouncy balls?

09:50.138 --> 09:52.349
Are you going to throw them at her feet?

09:52.516 --> 09:53.850
This is so embarrassing!

09:54.017 --> 09:56.978
I get it.
It's what kids do to tease each other.

09:57.145 --> 10:00.106
This would make Chisa really mad.

10:00.273 --> 10:03.151
You're right.
She might kill you, Iori.

10:03.318 --> 10:05.445
Who said I'm the one who's going to do it?

10:05.612 --> 10:07.197
It's Chisa.
So you should do it.

10:07.364 --> 10:09.282
Let's decide with rock, paper, scissors!

10:09.449 --> 10:11.993
- I have a better idea.
- What is it?

10:12.160 --> 10:16.498
Let's all throw them at the same time
so she doesn't know who did it.

10:16.665 --> 10:19.000
That's not a bad idea, coming from you.

10:19.167 --> 10:20.710
Then, let's go with that.

10:22.170 --> 10:25.257
Ready! One, two...

10:25.423 --> 10:27.801
Take this!

10:33.932 --> 10:36.726
- Nice!
- Do it!

10:43.316 --> 10:44.943
Nice control, Iori!

10:45.110 --> 10:48.154
You're the only one who can do this kind of thing!

10:48.321 --> 10:50.407
Leave it to me!

10:52.576 --> 10:55.412
Are you okay?

10:55.579 --> 10:58.373
Why aren't you guys throwing them?

11:12.637 --> 11:14.431
Hurry up and let her
execute you.

11:14.598 --> 11:16.641
You bastard! You act like you're innocent!

11:19.603 --> 11:20.937
A ghost!

11:21.104 --> 11:25.191
You were in the women's beauty pageant...
Cakey?

11:25.358 --> 11:26.735
Hey, you...

11:26.902 --> 11:28.236
What is it?

11:28.403 --> 11:30.405
Please go out with me.

11:31.531 --> 11:33.950
GRAND BLUE DREAMING

11:34.492 --> 11:37.454
Go out with you? You and me?

11:37.621 --> 11:39.039
Yeah. Got a problem with that?

11:39.205 --> 11:41.583
Hold on! I don't even know your name.

11:41.750 --> 11:44.544
Aina Yoshiwara, a freshman at
Oumi Women's University. Okay?

11:44.711 --> 11:46.254
Not at all.

11:46.421 --> 11:49.549
Congratulations, Kohei.
I hope you live happily ever after.

11:50.008 --> 11:51.927
Where do you think you're going?

11:52.093 --> 11:54.596
I thought you two should spend time alone.

11:54.763 --> 11:58.516
How can you leave me alone like this?
That's so inhumane!

11:58.683 --> 12:02.646
You left me to die just now, you loser.

12:02.812 --> 12:04.064
Never mind.

12:04.898 --> 12:06.483
What was that about?

12:06.650 --> 12:08.485
So that's where you guys were.

12:08.652 --> 12:10.153
What were you doing?

12:10.320 --> 12:14.115
- Experiencing youth.
- What?

12:14.282 --> 12:16.076
Cheers!

12:20.997 --> 12:24.125
- You've got the wrong guy.
- I haven't said anything yet.

12:24.292 --> 12:27.587
It's not what you think!
I did it to draw out your charm!

12:27.754 --> 12:30.465
I wanted to show the audience
how cute you are!

12:30.632 --> 12:32.133
That's enough.

12:33.134 --> 12:34.803
You're forgiving me?

12:34.970 --> 12:35.971
I owe you one.

12:36.137 --> 12:38.807
Really? Thanks, Chisa!

12:38.974 --> 12:42.102
To show my appreciation,
I'll buy you some sexy underwear.

12:42.727 --> 12:44.854
She said she'd forgive you. What a waste.

12:45.021 --> 12:47.899
So you looked!
You pervert!

12:49.609 --> 12:50.902
Chisa?

12:51.069 --> 12:54.364
Are you really mad?

12:54.531 --> 12:56.032
SHOCHU

12:56.199 --> 12:57.617
I'll drink it.

12:58.785 --> 13:00.328
Thanks for the drink.

13:00.495 --> 13:02.580
He drank two liters.

13:02.747 --> 13:03.832
That took some guts.

13:03.999 --> 13:05.417
Impressive, Iori!

13:05.583 --> 13:07.252
I'm back.

13:07.419 --> 13:08.461
You're late.

13:08.628 --> 13:09.879
Did something happen?

13:10.046 --> 13:12.674
Some guy was hitting on me.

13:12.841 --> 13:14.384
Are you okay?

13:15.427 --> 13:16.428
Yeah.

13:16.594 --> 13:19.139
You promised earlier today, right?

13:19.305 --> 13:21.474
I already have plans.

13:21.641 --> 13:24.185
It's okay. You're talking about those guys, right?

13:24.352 --> 13:25.687
Come on.

13:25.854 --> 13:28.606
MEN'S BEAUTY PAGEANT
REGISTRATION DEADLINE: 30 MINUTES LEFT

13:28.773 --> 13:30.859
Aren't you going to enter the men's pageant?

13:31.026 --> 13:33.445
I'm letting the younger students
do it this year.

13:33.611 --> 13:35.864
Did you want to see me compete?

13:36.031 --> 13:38.950
Yes! I do!
I'll cheer for you in the front row.

13:39.117 --> 13:41.453
Well, if you insist...

13:41.619 --> 13:44.164
I ran away while he was registering.

13:44.330 --> 13:45.957
Impressive, Azusa.

13:46.124 --> 13:48.501
- Are you going to cheer for him?
- Of course not.

13:48.668 --> 13:51.337
- That's terrible.
- I'm glad you're safe.

13:51.504 --> 13:53.256
You're in time for our gathering.

13:53.423 --> 13:55.175
That's right.

13:55.341 --> 13:56.342
Gathering?

13:56.509 --> 13:58.803
We're here, just like we promised!

13:58.970 --> 14:00.847
RUGBY CLUB

14:01.014 --> 14:04.559
Contain your excitement,
Iori and Kohei!

14:06.519 --> 14:09.314
This drinking party is crazier than usual.

14:10.398 --> 14:11.858
Oh, that's...

14:12.609 --> 14:14.110
You guys...

14:14.277 --> 14:16.946
You...

14:17.113 --> 14:18.573
Cakey! Wait! Wait! Wait!

14:22.535 --> 14:25.622
Why me? Go drink with the guys from the tennis club!

14:25.789 --> 14:27.707
What did you say?

14:27.874 --> 14:29.667
Why did I ask you out?

14:29.834 --> 14:31.586
That's not what I mean...

14:31.753 --> 14:33.088
She smells like alcohol.

14:33.838 --> 14:36.591
It's because you're hot.

14:37.550 --> 14:41.346
Just like the tennis club.
They're all hot. That's why I joined.

14:41.513 --> 14:44.099
I thought I'd be happy if I found a boyfriend.

14:44.265 --> 14:47.227
Then I'd have the perfect college life I dreamed of!

14:47.936 --> 14:51.606
But... Tell me!

14:51.773 --> 14:54.776
Why do I always end up like this?

14:54.943 --> 14:57.946
- She's a drunk mess.
- All that makeup isn't helping.

14:58.113 --> 15:00.406
I'm trying really hard, right?

15:00.573 --> 15:03.118
- I'm trying really hard!
- Yeah.

15:03.284 --> 15:05.537
You were trying hard.
In a bad way.

15:05.703 --> 15:08.540
I studied how to do makeup,

15:08.706 --> 15:11.793
and dressed up in clothes I'm not used to.

15:11.960 --> 15:13.795
I tried so hard to fit in,

15:13.962 --> 15:16.297
and did things I didn't want to.

15:16.464 --> 15:19.008
Movies and shows didn't teach me that!

15:19.175 --> 15:21.761
- Well...
- I bet.

15:23.471 --> 15:27.058
Why does everyone make a fool out of me?

15:27.225 --> 15:30.228
- Everyone?
- She's talking about the guys from Tinkerbell.

15:30.395 --> 15:31.938
Well, dressed like that...

15:32.105 --> 15:34.315
With that much makeup,
they'd think she's weird.

15:34.482 --> 15:37.110
Everyone said I was cute at first!

15:37.277 --> 15:39.279
Everyone was laughing!

15:40.405 --> 15:41.823
You let it slip out.

15:41.990 --> 15:44.409
Did I hurt you?

15:44.576 --> 15:47.162
Even I already knew that.

15:47.328 --> 15:50.331
At first, I didn't mind being treated as a joke.

15:50.498 --> 15:53.585
As long as I could be friends and have fun,
I was okay with it.

15:53.751 --> 15:56.588
- Really?
- Then isn't this what you wanted?

15:56.754 --> 16:01.467
But at the drinking party after the pageant,
those guys told me...

16:01.634 --> 16:05.180
"We've laughed enough.
You can go home now."

16:07.390 --> 16:11.227
I shouldn't have tried so hard to change.

16:11.394 --> 16:14.939
No matter what I do,
I'm always getting laughed at.

16:15.106 --> 16:17.775
And they're the ones laughing at me.

16:18.401 --> 16:21.196
- Cakey, You...
- What are you talking about?

16:21.821 --> 16:26.993
There's no one who's always laughing,
or always getting laughed at.

16:27.160 --> 16:28.494
But...

16:28.661 --> 16:30.705
I'll show you something interesting.

16:32.832 --> 16:35.752
IZU UNIVERSITY SPRING FESTIVAL
MEN'S BEAUTY PAGEANT

16:37.378 --> 16:40.256
- Nice!
- Yeah!

16:40.423 --> 16:45.428
You guys always mistake the male pageant
for a bodybuilding contest.

16:45.595 --> 16:48.765
Look who's talking!

16:49.432 --> 16:50.892
Up next!

16:51.059 --> 16:54.020
I'm Kudo, the captain of the tennis club.

16:54.187 --> 16:55.897
Nice to meet you.

16:57.440 --> 16:59.400
Can you say a few words about your club?

16:59.567 --> 17:00.610
You're so casual.

17:00.777 --> 17:02.487
Because I'm talking with a guy.

17:02.654 --> 17:04.781
Kudo, you can do it!

17:04.948 --> 17:06.032
Captain!

17:06.199 --> 17:08.284
You're going to win this year too!

17:08.451 --> 17:11.788
Of course!
I'm on a different level from the others!

17:11.955 --> 17:14.249
Next!

17:17.001 --> 17:19.295
- A pretty boy!
- Why is he in a uniform?

17:19.462 --> 17:21.256
Wasn't he with the naked idiots?

17:21.422 --> 17:23.049
I'm Kohei Imamura from Peek-a-Boo.

17:23.216 --> 17:26.302
It doesn't matter.
I'm going to win anyway.

17:26.469 --> 17:28.012
A few words, please.

17:30.556 --> 17:32.141
Azusa Hamaoka!

17:32.308 --> 17:36.187
Please go out with me,
not Captain Kudo from Tinkerbell!

17:36.354 --> 17:40.275
Imamura confessed his feelings!

17:40.900 --> 17:42.235
He stands out.

17:42.402 --> 17:45.780
How dare he use my name without asking?

17:47.490 --> 17:49.575
No. Choose me instead.

17:49.742 --> 17:53.288
Captain Kudo also confessed his feelings!

17:57.500 --> 18:00.295
Who is she going to choose?

18:01.754 --> 18:05.216
Whoa, it's Captain Kudo!

18:05.383 --> 18:08.011
Sorry things turned out like this.

18:08.177 --> 18:11.222
People are all at different levels.

18:11.389 --> 18:14.934
I bet there's a good match out there somewhere
for you too.

18:15.518 --> 18:18.187
A good match?

18:25.403 --> 18:28.448
Too bad! I'm a man!

18:29.657 --> 18:31.159
Oh, really?

18:31.326 --> 18:34.912
I never imagined I was a good match for Captain Kudo
from Tinkerbell!

18:35.079 --> 18:36.247
That's great, Kitahara!

18:36.414 --> 18:39.500
You guys are on the same level
when you're dressed up like a girl!

18:39.667 --> 18:44.088
Iori Kitahara from Peek-a-Boo
is entering the male pageant!

18:45.506 --> 18:47.008
They did it.

18:47.175 --> 18:48.926
Hey, hold on! I--

18:49.093 --> 18:53.097
What should I do?
The captain confessed his feelings for me!

18:53.264 --> 18:55.475
It hurts to lose,
but I'll step aside.

18:55.642 --> 18:59.020
Captain, I hope you two have a long happy life together!

18:59.187 --> 19:01.981
- Who are those guys?
- Kudo! What's going on?

19:02.607 --> 19:03.775
No! This is--

19:03.941 --> 19:05.818
Oh, right, captain.

19:05.985 --> 19:07.779
We've laughed enough.

19:07.945 --> 19:10.114
- You can go home now.
- You can go home now.

19:14.952 --> 19:16.621
Pretty funny, right?

19:21.626 --> 19:24.629
They did it!

19:29.634 --> 19:34.514
Congratulations on the women's beauty pageant
and the male pageant!

19:35.640 --> 19:38.643
Let's have a toast! A toast!

19:38.810 --> 19:40.061
That's a washbowl.

19:40.228 --> 19:43.022
You can't toast with that.

19:43.189 --> 19:45.066
Hey.

19:46.025 --> 19:47.902
I just want to--

19:48.069 --> 19:50.279
How should I put this...

19:51.823 --> 19:52.949
What's this?

19:53.116 --> 19:54.283
It's what it looks like.

19:54.450 --> 19:56.744
Do you want a bigger bucket?

19:56.911 --> 19:58.454
That's not what I mean. I--

19:58.621 --> 20:00.498
Drinking is better with lots of people!

20:00.665 --> 20:02.417
Don't just stand there.
Sit down.

20:07.630 --> 20:11.968
What? If you want to drink with me,
then you should just tell me.

20:12.135 --> 20:13.845
That's not what we mean.

20:14.011 --> 20:15.346
Your makeup is thick as oil.

20:15.513 --> 20:16.931
Just drop it already!

20:19.058 --> 20:20.643
What's this? It's too strong.

20:20.810 --> 20:23.604
- Of course!
- You finished it?

20:23.771 --> 20:25.982
We've been trained well!

20:26.149 --> 20:28.401
- They're good freshmen.
- Right?

20:28.568 --> 20:31.237
- Give them to us.
- In your dreams.

20:31.404 --> 20:33.698
They were against it at the beginning.

20:33.865 --> 20:36.033
I was surprised when they asked me too.

20:36.200 --> 20:38.161
It turned out great in the end.

20:38.327 --> 20:40.496
Especially for her.

20:40.663 --> 20:41.956
OKONOMIYAKI

20:42.707 --> 20:45.334
You were in the beauty pageant, right?
You're so cute!

20:45.501 --> 20:46.711
Can I take your order?

20:46.878 --> 20:50.465
We have a yakitori stall.
Want to hang out later?

20:50.631 --> 20:51.632
No thanks.

20:51.799 --> 20:54.260
Hey, we talked to her first!

20:54.427 --> 20:56.512
Don't be so cold!

20:56.679 --> 20:59.724
Just let the other two handle the stall.

20:59.891 --> 21:01.225
Stop!

21:04.812 --> 21:07.648
Do you have some business with her?

21:07.815 --> 21:10.276
She looks unhappy.

21:10.443 --> 21:12.069
Hey! Get lost!

21:12.236 --> 21:14.280
- Are you okay?
- Yeah.

21:14.447 --> 21:16.866
Come on.
Those guys are useless.

21:17.033 --> 21:18.659
Hey! Get up, you guys!

21:18.826 --> 21:20.661
It's time for the award ceremony.

21:20.828 --> 21:23.623
Congratulations on winning!

21:24.665 --> 21:25.666
Thanks.

21:25.833 --> 21:29.670
The audience liked your stage performance.

21:29.837 --> 21:32.632
- What's wrong?
- She looks mad.

21:32.798 --> 21:34.675
Well, that makes sense.

21:34.842 --> 21:36.802
- What?
- Why?

21:36.969 --> 21:41.641
Well, Chii-chan entered the pageant
just for Iori and the others.

21:42.308 --> 21:46.187
But Iori and the others
worked hard for another girl.

21:46.354 --> 21:48.689
Chii-chan gets bothered by guys

21:48.856 --> 21:50.942
because she entered the pageant,

21:51.108 --> 21:53.611
but no one helped her.

21:53.778 --> 21:55.321
That'd make anyone mad.

21:55.488 --> 21:56.906
Now that you mention it...

21:57.073 --> 21:59.575
I'd feel mad too.

21:59.742 --> 22:03.120
Who do you want to share this happiness with?

22:04.455 --> 22:06.207
Yes. Well...

22:06.374 --> 22:08.584
I want to share it with my boyfriend,

22:08.751 --> 22:11.170
who's passed out drunk over there.

22:13.172 --> 22:15.508
Your boyfriend? Him?

22:15.675 --> 22:17.218
He's a pervert!

22:17.385 --> 22:20.263
I see. She used Iori to repel other guys.

22:20.429 --> 22:22.974
So now they're a couple?

22:23.140 --> 22:25.393
Come on. Those two...

22:25.560 --> 22:27.478
What are they going to do?

22:27.645 --> 22:31.899
Kill him! Kill him! Kill him!

22:32.400 --> 22:33.401
DEEP BLUE AL FINE
KAYA MIZUKI

22:33.609 --> 22:35.695
Here's your mic, Kitahara.

22:35.903 --> 22:39.949
Me, too...? All right, let's do this!

22:40.116 --> 22:43.452
- Yeah, sing your heart out.
- You guys seem to be having fun.

22:45.121 --> 22:51.127
A fairytale whispers
In a fake world

22:51.294 --> 22:57.049
Hiding in the complete darkness

22:57.216 --> 23:03.014
I reach for the forbidden fruit
In my last days

23:03.180 --> 23:09.312
Now I know the meaning of the song about hope

23:09.478 --> 23:14.567
A broken gear will never stop again

23:14.734 --> 23:22.158
Even if I were to lose everything
I'd still want you to know

23:22.325 --> 23:28.247
Trapped in the sky so far away
I'm praying with ripped off wings

23:28.456 --> 23:34.211
Because we span together
The vows of areppegio

23:34.378 --> 23:40.134
If life sparkles only to the beat
of the resonating stars

23:40.301 --> 23:43.137
I'll sacrifice everything

23:43.304 --> 23:47.683
Till death do us apart

23:47.892 --> 23:49.769
Cheers!

23:54.565 --> 23:57.193
Thank you!

24:02.073 --> 24:03.908
I might just be imagining things.

24:04.075 --> 24:05.534
What? Kitahara?

24:05.701 --> 24:07.995
Everyone's looking at me differently.

24:10.331 --> 24:13.918
What? Is something happening to me?
Am I going to die tomorrow?

24:14.085 --> 24:16.152
Tell me! What's going on?

24:16.153 --> 24:16.921
NEXT EPISODE
"TOO LATE"
